{"step_index":6157,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-25T11:19:23Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-25T11:19:23Z\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/task-6157\nTask Description: sudo python3 -c \"\nimport struct, os\n\nSTART_OFFSET = 180 * 1024 * 1024 * 1024\nCHUNK_SIZE = 32 * 1024 * 1024\nvalid_brands = [b'isom', b'iso2', b'mp41', b'mp42', b'avc1', b'qt  ', b'M4V ', b'MSNV']\n\ndev = open('/dev/nvme1n1', 'rb')\ndev.seek(START_OFFSET)\noffset = START_OFFSET\n\nfound = []\nfor i in range(1300): # ~41 GB\n    chunk = dev.read(CHUNK_SIZE)\n    if not chunk:\n        break\n    pos = 0\n    while True:\n        pos = chunk.find(b'ftyp', pos)\n        if pos == -1:\n            break\n        if pos >= 4:\n            brand = chunk[pos+4:pos+8]\n            if brand in valid_brands:\n                box_sz = struct.unpack('>I', chunk[pos-4:pos])[0]\n                if 16 <= box_sz <= 1024:\n                    abs_pos = offset + pos - 4\n                    found.append((abs_pos, brand.decode('latin1', 'replace'), box_sz))\n        pos += 4\n    offset += len(chunk)\n\nprint(f'Total MP4 headers found: {len(found)}')\nfor f in found[:10]:\n    print('  Offset:', f[0], 'Brand:', f[1], 'BoxSz:', f[2])\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///home/azureuser/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/47f3f05e-b686-4d3d-9ae2-f215c03ab86b/.system_generated/tasks/task-6157.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
